@direction LR
@spacing 60

[1 - A bot pulls new businesses for each niche and verifies every email address] -> [2 - Claude researches each business and writes a personal first line for them]
[2 - Claude researches each business and writes a personal first line for them] -> [3 - Instantly sends the campaigns from about 45 warmed inboxes on 15 domains]
[3 - Instantly sends the campaigns from about 45 warmed inboxes on 15 domains] -> [4 - A bot checks every inbox's health each day and flags anything that's slipping]
[4 - A bot checks every inbox's health each day and flags anything that's slipping] -> [5 - When someone replies, a bot reads it and sorts it into one of 11 types]
[5 - When someone replies, a bot reads it and sorts it into one of 11 types] -> {6 - Is the right answer one of the replies I've already approved?}
{6 - Is the right answer one of the replies I've already approved?} -> "Yes" -> [7 - If it is, it goes out and offers two open call times from my calendar]
{6 - Is the right answer one of the replies I've already approved?} -> "No" -> [6b - If not, the bot drafts a reply and sends it to me to approve first]
[6b - If not, the bot drafts a reply and sends it to me to approve first] -> [7 - If it is, it goes out and offers two open call times from my calendar]
[7 - If it is, it goes out and offers two open call times from my calendar] -> [8 - If the lead goes quiet, a follow-up bot keeps checking in on a set schedule]
[8 - If the lead goes quiet, a follow-up bot keeps checking in on a set schedule] -> [9 - Booked calls land in my GHL pipeline and get reminders before the call]
[9 - Booked calls land in my GHL pipeline and get reminders before the call] -> [10 - Every morning and evening, a reporting bot sends me the numbers]
